# name|text, one per voice file. Names follow Yaapu's sound files (github.com/yaapu/frskytelemetryscript,
# GPL-3.0) so its language folders are interchangeable with these packs. Numbered names are Yaapu's
# status-text hashes; scripts/omnideck/audio.lua maps the message text to them.

